'''Masa''' is a [[Pixies|pixie]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] [[Merchants|merchant]] that can be found at the [[Lakeshore]] Crafting Station near the Lakeshore [[Cooking Table]]. He sells exclusively [[Blacksmith]] [[Jobs|Job]] [[Items|items]].

==Sells==
*{{Member}}[[Combining Blacksmith Apron]]
*{{Member}}[[Combining Blacksmith Goggles]]
*{{Member}}[[Combining Blacksmith Gloves]]
*{{Member}}[[Combining Blacksmith Boots]]
*{{Member}}[[Combining Blacksmith Shirt]]
*[[Blacksmith's Flair Shard of Tempering]]
*[[Blacksmith's Power Shard of Talent III]]
*[[Blacksmith's Ring of Talent III]]
*[[Blacksmith's Forgeblower of Talent III]]
*[[Eclipse Infused Wand Recipe]]

==Trivia==
*Masa was introduced in-game on August 6, 2013.
